 "text": "Hello, everyone. Welcome to Mission and Margin. In this session, we'll focus on financial fluency, which is a cornerstone of effective leadership. At Vanderbilt, we know that mission without margin is unsustainable, and margin without mission is meaningless. Leaders must be fluent in both. Financial fluency is not about becoming CFOs. It's about understanding how our decisions shape the resources that make our mission possible. The stronger our financial fluency, the bolder we can be in research, discovery, and education. In this session, you'll see how mission and margin work together and how every leader plays a role in sustaining them. The goal is simple: to give you the tools to make sound choices that protect our mission and maintain the financial strength that will help secure Vanderbilt's place as the great university of the twenty-first century.",
